From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 12:50:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: delete orphan vendor LLM provider crates

anthropic, mistral, deepseek, x_ai, open_router, bedrock had zero
workspace referrers after the cloud-provider strip (language_models
registers only Ollama/LMStudio/OpenAI-compatible). They were dead
workspace members carrying hardcoded vendor endpoints. Deleted outright
so reintroduction fails to resolve.

Kept: open_ai, google_ai (wire types used by agent_servers/opencode),
codestral (BYO edit prediction), ollama, lmstudio.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
